    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Fedya shakes his head, knowing his friend should have listened to him. Next time you watch the episode, listen for the Russian expressions for 'well' and 'very' — you will catch every word right away. See you in the next scene.",
      "gap": 0.5
